00:10:26.079 --> 00:10:27.829
/note and give my feedback there and

00:10:27.839 --> 00:10:30.389
uses haiku to just park that in a file

00:10:30.399 --> 00:10:31.990
just for that skill. And whenever I'm

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:33.670
ready or my usage limits are about to

00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:35.269
reset, I just ask Claude to go through

00:10:35.279 --> 00:10:37.350
