00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:38.949
And this works for me because throughout

00:10:38.959 --> 00:10:40.949
my work in my operating system, I

00:10:40.959 --> 00:10:42.870
usually think of new ideas that I think

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:44.790
I would want Claude to do next. but just

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.389
not right now. The second thing that I

00:10:46.399 --> 00:10:48.470
use is a skill called calibrate. Now, by

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:50.630
