00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:53.670
something is worth keeping. But

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:55.430
sometimes if a piece of feedback is

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:57.269
really important, you usually don't want

00:10:57.279 --> 00:10:58.870
