routinely provides me with ways to

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.750
improve my setup. And this also has a

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:21.590
section for memory. And so I just pick

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:23.590
the ones that I like here and ask Claude

